  "name": "Crown of Madness",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A Humanoid you can see makes a WIS save or is Charmed while you concentrate. Before moving on each of its turns it must make a melee attack against a creature you mentally choose (it acts normally if you choose none or none is in reach). It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns. On your later turns you must take a Magic action to keep control, or the spell ends.</p>",
